{
  "title": "科技回调段——老登底部区域，短期还看红利。",
  "author": "顶底之王",
  "publish_time": "",
  "url": "http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODM4ODM5Mg==&mid=2247486945&idx=1&sn=6b767ebfc6508d9f882938761cd19f53&chksm=f8be65cd1a387c174cce0c2a617501d4d365f649ac9534a4f2ca6a3814a6c6949ae4da610d51&scene=27#wechat_redirect",
  "content_text": "科技已经是下跌趋势，短期最好还以红利为主！\n昨天科创板创业板缩量反弹，缩量上涨还会上涨，所以今天开盘惯性上冲，但反弹颈线附近也是再次下跌。\n他们现在都已经是小波段下跌趋势了，只要反弹不破高点，就还会再次下跌。\n科技就算下一波还有行情，也很难从这拉起来。\n第一科创相关高位放巨量，也出现了好几个顶部迹象。\n第二小波段已经走出下跌趋势。\n第三下方大支撑没到，也没有缩量地量的底部信号。\n所有条件都不满足。\n而和科技反向性最强的，就是红利指数了。\n红利里虽然有分化，比如之前是煤炭涨带动中证红利上涨，今天变成银行涨煤炭跌带动红利低波上涨。\n但他们都是上涨趋势，总体重心上移。短期看都没什么问题。\n而低估值老登板块，现在也出现了很多底部迹象，这个位置很有机会见底。\n不过现在还是科技下跌带领大盘回调，老登板块就算见底也不会逆势上涨。大概率就是先震荡筑底等缩量，等大盘同步见底再涨，还需要耐心等待一段时间。\n刘广义\nA0260626040026\n投资有风险 入市需谨慎\n个人观点 仅供参考\n案例截图不做投资依据\n上海中广云证券咨询有限公司",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">科技已经是下跌趋势，短期最好还以红利为主！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">昨天科创板创业板缩量反弹，缩量上涨还会上涨，所以今天开盘惯性上冲，但反弹颈线附近也是再次下跌。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003293\" data-ratio=\"0.35\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Bgib4dvhgGgywpcnLffia5LkYsMqW8Kiab9wgpXqWp0U9mxJsFXSRpTHITqibg5eteXpibYroHjOiaibtUcM5mDawxkxq6wBMLXlh5O8icQlN2RZNSI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"780\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">他们现在都已经是小波段下跌趋势了，只要反弹不破高点，就还会再次下跌。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">科技就算下一波还有行情，也很难从这拉起来。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第一科创相关高位放巨量，也出现了好几个顶部迹象。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第二小波段已经走出下跌趋势。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第三下方大支撑没到，也没有缩量地量的底部信号。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">所有条件都不满足。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">而和科技反向性最强的，就是红利指数了。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">红利里虽然有分化，比如之前是煤炭涨带动中证红利上涨，今天变成银行涨煤炭跌带动红利低波上涨。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">但他们都是上涨趋势，总体重心上移。短期看都没什么问题。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">而低估值老登板块，现在也出现了很多底部迹象，这个位置很有机会见底。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">不过现在还是科技下跌带领大盘回调，老登板块就算见底也不会逆势上涨。大概率就是先震荡筑底等缩量，等大盘同步见底再涨，还需要耐心等待一段时间。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style='-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: center;'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !import